ses visible thinking state when switching between two active sessions","comments":5,"created_at":"2026-07-29T01:56:30Z"},{"number":506,"title":"[Bug][GUI] Stop button disappears (replaced by Send) after switching conversations while a turn is running — running turn becomes unstoppable","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-08-14T23:16:19Z"},{"number":191,"title":"需要中文","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-26T10:26:11Z"},{"number":36,"title":"[Security] macOS builds are signed + notarized, but Windows builds are not","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-23T20:25:38Z"},{"number":427,"title":"Lack of Simplified Chinese support and missing DeepSeek context integration","comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-03T11:11:31Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"v0.3.1","tag":"v0.3.1","published_at":"2026-10-05T21:12:52Z","body":"OpenWorker inside OpenShell. The CLI is published as an image, ghcr.io/andrewyng/openworker, so you can run a coworker fully inside an NVIDIA OpenShell sandbox with one command. When a site is blocked, the coworker asks and waits while you allow it.\r\n\r\nOpenShell 0.1.2. The desktop app's OpenShell option now works with OpenShell 0.1.2. If you are on OpenShell 0.0.x, upgrade OpenShell first. On a Mac, Docker Desktop's host networking must be on; Settings checks this and tells you. \"Allow everything\" is no longer offered with OpenShell.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Sandbox improvements - WebSearch follows allow-list. Agent can work egress policy server to request user for additions to network policy. \r\n* CLI improvements\r\n* Run OpenWorker inside an OpenShell sandbox \r\n* Supporting newer version of OpenShell - 0.1.2\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/andrewyng/openworker/compare/v0.3.0...v0.3.1","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}